QEMU "virt" board (qemu-system-m68k -M virt -cpu m68030).

Holds Config, the Makefile generated from it by kconfig, and the kernel
linker script kernel.ld (see docs/porting/, decision D13).

Build with "make" here; the kernel is unix.elf. Booting it on QEMU and
debugging it with GDB are described in docs/porting/README.md.
